			"notes": "# DonutAH 1.0.64 Changelog\n\n## Item searches now count as market data\n\nSearching the Auction House for an item no longer stops price scanning.\n\n### Changes\n- **`/ah <item>` results are now scanned** — e.g. `/ah diamond` or `/ah diamond sword` (sorted by Lowest Price) submits prices just like the normal AH page 1\n- **Player searches stay protected** — `/ah <playername>` and the Search button still never record listings, so your own listings can't poison the market data\n\n### Compatibility\n- Minecraft 1.21.11 and 26.1.x\n- Requires Fabric API and Cloth Config"
		},
