			"notes": "# DonutAH 1.0.63 Changelog\n\n## Fixed for the new Auction House\n\nDonutSMP redesigned the Auction House — this update makes DonutAH work with it again.\n\n### Fixes\n- **Price scanning works again** — the new AH layout (new price format, new Filter menu) is fully supported\n- **No more price lines on menu buttons** — Filter, Next Page, Quick Buy, Search, Your Items etc. no longer show a DonutAH tooltip\n- **Quick Buy and Your Items screens are never scanned** — only real Auction pages count as market data\n- **Your own listings are never recorded** — searching yourself (or anything) via `/ah <name>` or the Search button no longer submits those prices\n- **Huge prices display correctly** — trillion+ ($1T) prices are now parsed and shown properly\n\n### Compatibility\n- Minecraft 1.21.11 and 26.1.x\n- Requires Fabric API and Cloth Config"
		},
