			"notes": "## New Features\n\n### Price Trend & Volume in Tooltips (off by default)\n- Tooltips can now show a **24h price trend** arrow (▲ green / ▼ red) with the percentage change vs yesterday\n- Tooltips can also show **daily scan volume** — how many times that item has been seen today\n- Both are off by default. Turn them on in `/donutah settings`\n\n### Inventory Value (V key)\n- Press **V** while your inventory is open to see the total estimated market value of everything you're carrying\n- Uses the same live market data as the tooltips\n- Key is configurable in `/donutah settings`\n\n### `/donutah top` — Top Flip Opportunities\n- New command that shows the top items with the highest price spread between their cheapest and average listings\n- Useful for spotting flip opportunities without opening the AH\n\n---\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n### `/ah <player>` No Longer Scans Your Own Listings as Market Data\n- When you searched for your own username on the AH, the mod would incorrectly treat your own listings as fresh market data and submit them to the database\n- This is now fixed — the mod detects when you're viewing your own listings and skips the scan\n\n### Scan Timing Fix\n- In rare cases, the AH screen would be scanned before all item data had fully loaded\n- The mod now waits for two consecutive stable reads before submitting, eliminating phantom or partial scans\n\n---\n\n**Requirements:** Minecraft 1.21.11 · Fabric Loader · Fabric API · [Cloth Config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)"
